Real gross domestic income (GDI) increased 4.4 percent in the third quarter, compared with an increase
of 2.3 percent (revised) in the second quarter. The average of real GDP and real GDI also increased 4.4
percent, compared with an increase of 2.2 percent (revised).

Profits from current production (corporate profits with inventory valuation and capital consumption
adjustments) increased $206.0 billion in the third quarter, compared with an increase of $384.0 billion in
the second quarter.

